{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4ddfbb4bb08c20b0fda2b738f7308fbb253c98fd148be7681721c137f12eae4c", "ja": "（近くまで来たので、今日のお昼は美奈子の家の\n『佐竹飯店』で食べる事にした……）", "zh": "（因为来到美奈子家经营的『佐竹饭店』附近，\n我决定今天在这里吃午餐……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
