{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0103_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "0105ef80fe1bad75c988c286d6fbc13ac8b5d054f53ee2fd659668354d38172e", "ja": "はい、お冷とおしぼり！\nそれとこっちは、前菜盛り合わせですっ！", "zh": "来，给你水跟湿毛巾！\n还有，这是前菜拼盘！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
