{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0103_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bbfba9fea9ce2e7b33f754900753c8ae29791d83d23b3ca09a6b55e573ab906f", "ja": "うわっ、なんだこの大皿！？\nというか、まだ注文してないんだけど……。", "zh": "呜哇，这么大盘是怎么回事！？\n话说，我根本还没有点菜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0103_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "089c3c2166ee27ac8ca8ed84b2602f6724899a7190e49dbbaf8ed96013810b29", "ja": "お父さんが、サービスだって！\nおかわりが欲しかったら、言ってくださいね♪", "zh": "爸爸说要请你的！\n要是想再来一盘，就告诉我吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0103_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f5f9d6c5bf6812ed9a7c8d7bf52ffd91ccd46df94d531e5f7d6ec7a7caca5501", "ja": "う、うん、ありがとう。\nこれだけでお腹いっぱいになりそうだな……。", "zh": "知、知道了，谢谢你。\n感觉吃这些就很饱了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0103_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "b626690ca641f9165caf22a7f9282ce8a224241a7ecf98769a8bb207ff3f4cba", "ja": "そんな！　前菜だけなんて、ダメですよ！\nメインは何にしますか？", "zh": "怎么可以！不能光吃前菜喔！\n请问你主餐要点什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0103_1008_p", "source_sha256": "171d39b6b444436429729de08d5a18982906bb9c2fc252505bdbea30020574f5", "ja": "そうだな……\nじゃあ、チャーハンをひとつ。", "zh": "这个嘛……\n那给我一份炒饭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0103_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "ab944f389e47f1fe33948d6aac9a180dcefbbd30c4df231c099de7bb4e828931", "ja": "かしこまりました！\n少々お待ちくださいね♪", "zh": "我明白了！\n请稍候片刻喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0103_1010_p", "source_sha256": "aef69189f729d7adc017751d35c122cd1bc96a05883865e42534880190db34c3", "ja": "美奈子、このチャーハンすごく美味しいよ。\n普通のチャーハンとは、ちょっと違うんだな？", "zh": "美奈子，这盘炒饭非常好吃喔。\n跟普通的炒饭有点不一样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0103_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "780949a8dcbe5377f1156db51be0700d6197d5e840a5a70dde78d1cadb18dc38", "ja": "わ、さすが{$P$}さん、鋭いですね！\nこの前、南の島に行ったじゃないですか。", "zh": "哇，不愧是{$P$}先生，味觉真灵敏！\n之前我们不是去了南方小岛吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0103_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "ce0d5f3826dbc7354c50458a872dbbf5ea62708bac3de8d919e541d1458a3483", "ja": "その時、お土産で買ってきた塩やスパイスを、\n料理に使ってみたんです。", "zh": "我当时买了盐跟香料当纪念品，\n回来就试着用在料理中了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0103_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d0e92f6a6ec337a250fb11652e674fc5ede2baab1547607c59e6ead917a35226", "ja": "なるほど、あの時の……\n言われてみると、ちょっと南国っぽいな。", "zh": "原来如此，是那时候的……\n听你这么一说，是有一点南国风味。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0103_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "edd1c57b915f49d8318eacdc02950b5a31b4e2455228b388fab16549661a6407", "ja": "そうなんです！\n気づいてもらえてよかった～。", "zh": "就是这样！\n你能察觉到真是太好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0103_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "bdb1b859a1acc5e4c90a2c3d028fab3e8451a7105af72883fc359b5134f1f2a0", "ja": "南の島もライブも、本当に楽しかったので！\n楽しかったバカンスの、おすそわけですよ♪", "zh": "去南方小岛跟举办演唱会，我真的都很开心！\n我想把愉快假期的滋味分享给大家♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0103_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e207f0a3d53674f0c63554f712d51db0ad9d48c4df8f2cd6ac3bc88fcd127aa9", "ja": "でも、本当にそれだけなのか？\nすごく美味しいけど……。", "zh": "不过，真的只有这样吗？\n这实在好吃到不行耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0103_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "b3ce90de5d8ee8513f12eb7d5dcef9aa41502dd7cf5717dc8065dfcb6f583915", "ja": "もちろん、隠し味も入ってます！\n愛情たっぷり、ですよ♪", "zh": "当然还有特别的佐料呀！\n就是满满的爱喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0103_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f3ccb91dad8b561b243cdcfa1decfd6091290e240d1fafb9227fa4698c0b6c9b", "ja": "その隠し味は、効果がすごそうだな！\nどうりで美味しいわけだ。", "zh": "看来这份佐料效果优异！\n怪不得会这么好吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0103_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "b71a166fdd3095fe8404e73f6d0f12803895fc7f3c852382b6cf3e77315b1894", "ja": "はい！　どんなお料理でも美味しくなっちゃう、\n最高のスパイスなんです。", "zh": "是的！\n这是能让任何料理都变好吃的顶级调味料。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0103_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "34edec53bc3378978d558cb1d9f45637795db4b14c5bcdd4637d9feae890adbf", "ja": "おかわり、まだまだいーっぱい、ありますから。\nどんどん食べちゃってくださいね♪", "zh": "吃不够还有非──常多，\n请你尽量吃吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
